config MTK_SENSORHUB
	tristate "MediaTek SCP sensor-hub transport and IIO frontend"
	depends on MTK_TINYSYS_SCP_SUPPORT
	depends on IIO
	help
	  Support for sensors owned by the MediaTek SCP sensor-hub firmware.
	  The SCP drives the physical ALS/IMU and streams samples over IPI plus
	  shared-memory rings; this option provides the transport, firmware
	  sensor enumeration and time synchronisation, and publishes ambient
	  light and acceleration as standard IIO devices.

	  Say Y here if you want SCP-backed sensors on a MediaTek SoC, for
	  example ambient-light based brightness or accelerometer-based screen
	  rotation.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here. The module will be
	  called sensorhub.
